{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roadsters Odyssey is a high-octane Vehicular Combat game set to debut on PC and console by late 2026. Strap in as a roadster and thrust into a volatile future where an enigmatic power shift has tilted the scales of conflict. Your mandate: seize victory on the circuit or face obliteration amidst the relentless clash of metal and mayhem.\u00a0 Enjoy the thrill of racing while destroying your opponent with loads of weapons and vehicles to choose from, enjoy the deep customization of vehicles and varieties of game mode to choose from race, deathmatch, survival and battle arena. we got you covered with loads of game modes for endless fun. A single sign on for you to easily switch between platforms without loosing out your creds and assets and many more to\u00a0 come in future.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3411740?t=1761735301","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411740/495484ccdbb05ba23199931a12d37c0358a81c13/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761735301","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411740/968eaab2585a6d18ad2a3e6bc0d566a6b21dae02/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761735301","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411740/968eaab2585a6d18ad2a3e6bc0d566a6b21dae02/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761735301","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"MMO","id":20},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Full controller sup